    "Process 64-by-256 tiles on successive anti-diagonals using static OpenMP work sharing in one persistent parallel region.",
    "Store right boundaries in an O(n) array; concurrent tiles own disjoint frontier columns and boundary rows, synchronized once per tile diagonal."
